# Doctor Octopus, Master Planner ({5}{U}{B}, 4/8): "Other Villains you control get +2/+2. Your maximum hand size is eight. At the beginning of
# your end step, if you have fewer than eight cards in hand, draw cards equal to the difference." Turn 3 (six Moxen and an Island) he is cast
# with an empty hand: at the end step Bot1 draws eight cards, and eight stay through the cleanup step (the maximum is eight, not seven). Turn 5:
# an Island and an Agents of Hydra (a Villain, 1/1 -> 3/3 beside him; Bot2's own Agents stays 1/1) leave seven in hand: one is drawn at the
# end step. Turn 7: an Island leaves exactly eight in hand and nothing is drawn, and no ability is even put on the stack (the condition is "fewer than", CR 603.4). Turn 9: nine in hand draw nothing and
# the cleanup step discards one, back to eight. Octopus himself stays 4/8.

